== what a unit can be ==
dragon           rồng
                 pokemon.charmander (Charmander)
                 note: a lineage rather than a body: what makes a skill about being a dragon carryable by more than one character
lizard           thằn lằn
                 pokemon.charmander (Charmander)
                 note: the body, which is what a creature can be at the same time as being a dragon
plant            thực vật
                 pokemon.bulbasaur (Bulbasaur)
                 note: something that grows, which is what roots and photosynthesis read as; the two skills that mean it stay restricted by element, because a shared preset holds them
turtle           rùa
                 pokemon.squirtle (Squirtle)
                 note: a shell, which withdraw was named after before it was reworded as a stance

4 kinds declared
